      "reason": "The preset library is humanoid and the quadruped rig names the front legs Clavicle/Upperarm/Hand, so a biped idle maps onto it and rears the animal onto its hind legs for the whole clip. Applies to every quadruped and avian rig in this set, not only the cow: all of them carry the identical 41-joint skeleton with identical bone names. Kept outside the repo as reproducible evidence; never promoted."
